by stof at 2026-04-14T14:06:02Z

@takashiraki phpstan has an equivalent feature (through `@phpstan-sealed`), and it reads the `@psalm-inheritors` tag as well to support libraries where the maintainer used the psalm tag (Psalm does not yet read the phpstan tag though, as [this is not implemented yet](https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/11510)). This will support both phpstan and psalm, which is sufficient with our current rule.

